From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CroaBeast <66433837+CroaBeast@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:44:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(automations): rule icons and compact rows with switch,
 edit and delete
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Kuraka-Severity: required
Kuraka-Missing-En: Automation rules have no icon, and the list uses tall cards with a status badge and a 3-dots menu instead of a direct switch, edit and delete.
Kuraka-Missing-Es: Las automatizaciones no tienen ícono, y la lista usa tarjetas altas con una etiqueta de estado y un menú de 3 puntos en vez de un interruptor, editar y borrar directos.
Kuraka-Adds-En: Each automation rule can have an icon, and the list uses compact rows with an on/off switch, edit and delete.
Kuraka-Adds-Es: Cada automatización puede tener un ícono, y la lista usa filas compactas con interruptor, editar y borrar.
